<title>Anthropic 拟以特殊治理结构抵御 IPO 后股东的安全施压 / Anthropic’s elaborate plan to keep Wall Street at bay</title>
<link>https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1019470/anthropic-ipo-resist-investor-pressure-cut-corners-safety</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1019470/anthropic-ipo-resist-investor-pressure-cut-corners-safety</guid>
<description>Anthropic 计划通过长期受益信托和 Founder LLC 等独特治理结构上市，在公开市场融资的同时防止股东迫使公司削弱安全投入。信托的五名投票受托人可通过 Class T 股票任命七名董事中的四席，七位创始人则以 Founder LLC 掌握 50.1% 投票权。法学专家认为法律层面可隔绝逐利压力，但市场竞争、融资需求和创始人离开都可能侵蚀这些保障。（The Verge：AI（RSS））</description>
<category>行业动态</category>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 16:51:22 +0000</pubDate>
</item>
