<item>
<title>Anthropic IPO 最大赢家或为 Amazon 而非 VC / VCs will make billions on Anthropic’s IPO, but Amazon is set to make much (much) more</title>
<link>https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/27/vcs-will-make-billions-on-anthropics-ipo-but-amazon-is-set-to-make-much-much-more</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/27/vcs-will-make-billions-on-anthropics-ipo-but-amazon-is-set-to-make-much-much-more</guid>
<description>TechCrunch 根据 Anthropic 的 S-1 分析，VC 持股均不足 5%，而 Amazon 可能是 IPO 最大财务受益方。Amazon 持有 62 亿美元本金可转债、其自估持仓价值 979 亿美元，另投 100 亿美元无投票权优先股，累计投资约 180 亿美元；Anthropic 还承诺未来 10 年在 AWS 至少消费 1100 亿美元。（TechCrunch：AI（RSS））</description>
<category>行业动态</category>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 01:15:28 +0000</pubDate>
